# Routines whose bodies are hand-written rather than generated. apple2tc emits
# a declaration for each, rewrites every call site to it, and deletes the
# blocks only that routine reached. The definitions live in rom.c,
# stitched into one translation unit by reference/neptune-ext.c.
#
# There is one line, and step 1's boundary measurement is why: of 4080
# disassembled instructions, 4032 are Neptune's own and the game calls exactly
# one ROM entry point. Snake Byte needed nine, and pulled in around 1,430 ROM
# blocks behind them.

# Apple II ROM entry points -- rom.c
FCA8 rom_mon_wait
